Lead360
A ChurchByte product
https://github.com/ChurchByte/blik360

Lead360 is a modified version of Blik, an open-source 360-degree feedback
platform created by Thijs de Zoete and contributors:
    https://github.com/thijsdezoete/blik

This is NOT the original Blik software. ChurchByte began modifying Blik in
September 2026 (including renaming it to Lead360); the dated history of all
modifications is recorded in this repository's commit history.

